# Web3Forms access key — issued at https://web3forms.com/ for the address
# that should receive inquiries. Web3Forms only accepts submissions made
# from the visitor's browser, so this value is public by design (it ships
# in the client bundle). Lock it to your domains in the Web3Forms
# dashboard; the key alone grants nothing but "send mail to the owner".
# Copy this file to .env.local and paste the key below.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
